[00:17.40]1. Can you see with your mind’s eye,
[00:25.68]Peoples dwelling together?
[00:35.04]Sorrow has passed. Peace at last!
[00:41.46]Life without tears or pain.
[00:51.62](Chorus)
[00:51.74]Sing out with joy of heart!
[00:56.98]You too can have a part.
[01:01.80]Live for the day when you’ll say,
[01:07.02]“Life without end, at last!”
[01:16.38]2. In those days all will be young,
[01:22.22]All at peace with Jehovah.
[01:27.42]Troubles are gone, from now on,
[01:32.40]No need to weep or fear.
[01:38.08](Chorus)
[01:39.42]Sing out with joy of heart!
[01:43.68]You too can have a part.
[01:49.52]Live for the day when you’ll say,
[01:55.08]“Life without end, at last!”
[02:28.78]3. Paradise all will enjoy
[02:33.40]As we sing of God’s glory.
[02:38.60]Long as we live, we will give
[02:43.68]Honor and praise to God.
[02:53.26](Chorus)
[02:53.82]Sing out with joy of heart!
[02:58.78]You too can have a part.
[03:04.76]Live for the day when you’ll say,
[03:09.80]“Life without end, at last!”
